<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="label">Help Centre</span>
    <h1>Shipping Information</h1>
    <p>Everything you need to know about delivery, tracking and international orders.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-content">

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:56px;">
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">📦</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.9375rem;">1–3 Business Days</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">Processing time</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🚚</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.9375rem;">Free Shipping</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">On US orders over $50</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">🌍</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.9375rem;">Ships Worldwide</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">International available</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Shipping Rates & Delivery</h2>
    <table class="page-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Method</th>
          <th>Estimated Delivery</th>
          <th>Cost</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Free Standard (USA)</strong></td>
          <td>5–8 business days</td>
          <td class="free">FREE on orders $50+</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Standard Shipping (USA)</td>
          <td>5–8 business days</td>
          <td>$4.99</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Express Shipping (USA)</strong></td>
          <td>2–3 business days</td>
          <td>$12.99</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>International</td>
          <td>10–20 business days</td>
          <td>From $9.99</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Processing Time</h2>
    <p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days after payment confirmation. Orders placed on weekends or holidays are processed the next business day. You'll receive a confirmation email with tracking once shipped.</p>

    <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
    <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive an email with your tracking number. Use the link in the email to track your package in real time via the carrier's website.</p>

    <h2>International Orders</h2>
    <p>We ship worldwide. International customers are responsible for any customs duties, taxes, or import fees. These charges are not included in our shipping rates and vary by country.</p>

    <h2>Lost or Damaged Orders</h2>
    <p>If your package arrives damaged or hasn't arrived within the estimated timeframe, contact us within 7 days of the expected delivery date. Include your order number and photos of any damage.</p>
    <p>📧 <a href="mailto:support@{{ shop.domain }}" style="color:var(--gold);">support@{{ shop.domain }}</a></p>

  </div>
</div>

